teamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1167680/extras/54dfd5f4c9b763881d7162bced94d597.mp4?t=1728902614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A HEAD-BLASTING SOUNDTRACK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1167680/extras/c3b4da396a1a58715a898ccdc23b72a6.webp?t=1728902614\" /></div>Orbital Bullet features a <strong>pounding electronica soundtrack</strong> composed by Juha Korpelainen &amp; Niilo Takalainen. If you die a lot, at least you can listen to some catchy tunes.</p>",
    "short_description": "Orbital Bullet is a fast paced 360\u00b0 action-platformer with rogue-lite elements, where all actions take place in a circular pattern. Fight your way through a variety of procedural planets and use body modifications, crafting and heavy weaponry. Kill. Die. Modify.",
