    "reviews": "\u201cCombined with its roguelike gameplay and mix of sprites and 3D models for its graphics, this game is a wholly unique experience.\u201d<br>IGN SEA<br><br>\u201cIs Orbital Bullet worth it? Definitely, since I haven\u2019t played a new action rogue-lite that I found this delightful in quite some time.\u201d<br>PC Invasion<br><br>\u201cIt\u2019s a true roguelite and feels fantastic, with some great features to make it stand out from the rest of the genre.\u201d<br>MoviesGamesAndTech<br>",
